  "2026-10-25T19:41:57.802Z","harness:codex","Refined source attribution: the four unmatched aggregate starts all report pm_version2026.10.24 and source_context automation. No current2026.10.25 mismatch is established by that cohort. Keep the intake open/unclaimed and retain termination or timeout as an unverified explanation rather than asserting ingestion loss."
  "2026-10-26T05:30:06.130Z","harness:codex","Fresh October26 live telemetry evidence extends this existing investigation: complete installation/session/command pairing since2026-10-25T23:39Z over producer2026.10.25/26 found1398 starts,1394 finishes and four settled unmatched starts. All four are producer2026.10.25 with source_context automation: aggregate at00:06:48Z, assurance at01:16:16Z, get at01:29:56Z and aggregate at03:17:42Z. Termination versus ingestion remains unverified; no2026.10.26 mismatch was established by this cohort. Keep the canonical investigation open and unclaimed. Forty command families show average ingestion1.229seconds; required seven-day error/code gate passes at5.22percent with zero missing failure codes. A fresh Sentry pm.command contracts span at05:26:14Z is visible, but streamed span detail is temporarily unavailable from the provider. This is operational evidence, not proof that every historical action has a finish."
